<p>Hello,</p>
<p><%= @from ? "#{@from} bought you" : "#{Rails.configuration.x.brand.name} is giving you" %> a <%= @kind %>: <strong><%= @product.title %></strong><%= " (every class in it)" if @kind == "program" %>.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Get your #{@kind}", @url %></p>
<p>You'll sign in, or make an account in a minute. The link works once and ends on <%= @gift.expires_at.to_date.to_fs(:long) %>. If you weren't expecting this, you can ignore it.</p>
<p><%= Rails.configuration.x.brand.name %>, an AI school</p>
